      "version_note": "musl assembles its version banner at runtime from a format string and a separate constant, so a stripped image yields the format string but not the version. In a Linux rootfs the exact version is in the package database (/lib/apk/db/installed, /usr/lib/opkg/status), which fw2sbom does not parse yet."
